,{"id":88629929799484,"name":"🎃 Button RNG 2","desc":"","path":"/game/88629929799484-button-rng-2","slug":"88629929799484-button-rng-2","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/aabc18ea98d518e3d7b4e14143bdef6ab6bc592987ab5fd3a6dda6a471fb51be.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-b51098163b41bb13af0b3c4aa1a2fb71/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":19,"visitor":0,"verified":false,"updatedAt":null,"creator":{"name":"Roblox","type":"User"},"script":{"count":0,"freeCount":0,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":17295191183,"name":"[🎄] Ultimate Town Multiplayer","desc":"THIS GAME IS STILL IN BETA AND HAS MANY FEATURES MISSING OR UNFINISHED!\n\nThis game is a multiplayer version of Ultimate Town Sandbox, another InfiniDev game.\n\n🗺️ Explore the town of Vitex with your friends! You can now meet NPCs, work jobs, fight enemies, cause explosions, drive vehicles, fly helicopters, dumpster dive, harvest plants, and so much more, together!\n\n🎮 Controls can be found by pressing the controller icon in the inventory.\nFor controller/console, press Select to access the virtual cursor.\n\n🏆 Premium players get +5 Gems per playtime reward, and +25% XP and Gems overall.\n\nTags: Town, Roleplay, City, Jobs, Houses, Vehicles, Cars, Boats, Helicopters, Police, Moods, Inventory, NPC, FPS, Enemies, Customization, Multiplayer","path":"/game/17295191183-ultimate-town-multiplayer","slug":"17295191183-ultimate-town-multiplayer","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/81dfa2038824322700323440405d1b5e5901bcce94d761b10c2c5ee75a776841.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-040fb1afe66548fb29e3bbe506f60ab6/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":19,"visitor":4490407,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-01-03T01:00:07.816Z","creator":{"name":"InfiniDev","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":5,"freeCount":4,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":89494216641846,"name":"Climb Worm Tower for Brainrots","desc":"Climb Worm Tower for Brainrots\n\nHow To Play:\n🧗 Climb the stairs as far as you can without being eaten by the WORM\n😂 Collect Brainrots from higher floors\n🍀 Invite your friends to beat the worm easily!\n💸 Your Brainrots generate you money!\n⚡ Make sure to use the safe zones to stay safe from the worms\n\n💤 Your Brainrots earn cash OFFLINE! ","path":"/game/89494216641846-climb-worm-tower-for-brainrots","slug":"89494216641846-climb-worm-tower-for-brainrots","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/da9da0ff5f09c0d9aa41c59abb266f94ed4331c07450c4a33a7289ae02114738.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-3e077d27440cbf53ae159eab235a0bbd/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":19,"visitor":31354867,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-02-16T15:41:29.846Z","creator":{"name":"Tung Tung Company","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":4,"freeCount":4,"keyCount":3,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":4474859677,"name":"CITY-17","desc":"[RP] CITY-17 | Mark III\nWelcome to the finest remaining urban center on Earth, City-17. Under the occupation of the Universal Union, dominated by the imposing Citadel, and surrounded by desolate wasteland, it's a site to behold.\n\nDisclaimer:\n1. This is a roleplay experience with a strict ruleset. Players are expected to understand and follow all systems in place. Join our communications server for more information.\n\n2. This experience is resource-intensive. A stable, modern device is recommended, as performance may vary depending on your hardware and player count.\n\n3. Some accounts will automatically be disqualified from this experience, due to security-measures against new/alternate accounts and cheaters.\n\n> Remember to 👍 & ⭐ the game to support us!\n> Make sure to join our communications server!\n\nTags: Half-Life, Half-Life 2, Garry's Mod, HL2:RP, Roleplay, RP, Sci-Fi, Dystopian, Cyberpunk, Resistance, Combine","path":"/game/4474859677-city-17","slug":"4474859677-city-17","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/8c1750233425496333d7b0118ae91ab24c986540b64a8f47bb731c08777b128b.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-4d121be8c54016532e50863bb0a6c1b3/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":19,"visitor":11317112,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-04-09T20:27:13.399Z","creator":{"name":"CMB | The Universal Union","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":78326551441316,"name":"Escape Getting Crushed For Brainrots","desc":"Welcome to Escape Getting Crushed For Brainrots\n\nDon't get crushed while collecting as many Brainrots as you can. Stay alert, move fast, and build your way to success!\n\nHow to play:\n🏃 Run, dodge, and avoid getting crushed\n🧠 Collect Brainrots to earn money\n💵 Upgrade your Brainrots to increase earnings\n🏗️ Improve your base to unlock more storage slots\n💤 Earn cash even while offline\n\n👍 Support the game by liking and favoriting — and join the group for bonus rewards!","path":"/game/78326551441316-escape-getting-crushed-for-brainrots","slug":"78326551441316-escape-getting-crushed-for-brainrots","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/28a933bbb69d8152fdc8650def237dee0e13f781afa441e98079aa090fa20aa9.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-22ad99fa23fddf0e0b427c7aa5749f70/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":19,"visitor":37502393,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-02-19T11:17:29.875Z","creator":{"name":"Grow a Polnareff","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":3,"freeCount":3,"keyCount":3,"verifiedCount":0}}],"totalGames":14204,"totalPages":592,"currentPage":230}